Description:

The parenthesized-list form of the IMAP GETMETADATA command now performs the
same mailbox ACL checks as the single-mailbox form.  Previously, an
authenticated user could use that form to distinguish between
"mailbox does not exist" and "mailbox exists, but you have no access to it",
creating an oracle for mailbox existence.

Tracked as GitHub security advisory GHSA-3wp4-ff49-m839.


